ew?","options":["The list of all records with columns and filters","An audit report","The main interface shown when opening a record","A process"],"explanation":"The summary view is the main screen of an individual record."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un registro de Cliente necesita, además de la vista de resumen, una vista con sus pedidos y otra con sus documentos. ¿Qué se configura?","options":["Vistas adicionales del record type","Tres record types distintos para el mismo cliente","Tres sitios","Tres grupos"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Un record type puede tener varias vistas que se muestran como pestañas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A Customer record needs, besides the summary view, a view of their orders and one of their documents. What's configured?","options":["Additional record type views","Three separate record types for the same customer","Three sites","Three groups"],"explanation":"A record type can have several views shown as tabs."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué se configura en la lista de registros (record list) de un record type?","options":["Los permisos de los process models","Columnas, filtros, búsqueda y acciones","La interfaz de cada registro individual","Los grupos"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"La lista define cómo se ven, buscan y filtran los registros.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's configured in a record type's record list?","options":["Process model permissions","Columns, filters, search and actions","Each individual record's interface","Groups"],"explanation":"The list defines how records are viewed, searched and filtered."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Los usuarios quieren filtrar la lista de solicitudes por estado con un desplegable. ¿Qué se configura en el record type?","options":["Una related action","Un filtro de usuario sobre el campo de estado","Un filtro por defecto que no puede cambiarse","Un grupo"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los filtros de usuario permiten a los usuarios filtrar la lista."