n un process model","En la seguridad del record type","En los filtros de usuario de la lista","En la vista de resumen"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"La seguridad del objeto define qué grupos pueden acceder al record type.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A developer must decide who can see a record type in Appian (object access). Where do they configure it?","options":["In a process model","In the record type's security","In the list's user filters","In the summary view"],"explanation":"Object security defines which groups can access the record type."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Una related action \"Editar\" debe mostrarse solo a los usuarios del grupo de gestores. ¿Qué se configura?","options":["Una constante","Ocultar el botón en la interfaz del formulario de edición","Un filtro por defecto","La visibilidad de la acción para ese grupo"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"La visibilidad de las acciones puede condicionarse a grupos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An \"Edit\" related action must only show to users in the managers group. What's configured?","options":["A constant","Hide the button in the edit form's interface","A default filter","The action's visibility for that group"],"explanation":"Action visibility can be conditioned on groups."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica una relación \"muchos a uno\" desde Pedido hacia Cliente?","options":["Cada cliente se relaciona con un solo pedido","Cada pedido tiene muchos clientes","Ninguna","Un cliente por pedido; varios pedidos por cliente"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Muchos pedidos apuntan a un mismo cliente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a \"many-to-one\" relationship from Order to Customer mean?","options":["Each customer relates to one order only","Each order has many customers","None","One customer per order; many orders per customer"],"explanation":"Many orders point to the same customer."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un registro debe mostrar los eventos de su historial (creado, mo