n do users in that environment see the change?","options":["Only after publishing a new process model version","After saving the modified objects","After restarting the server","Never"],"explanation":"Changes to interfaces and record types apply when saved in the environment."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué ventaja tiene configurar una related action con un formulario de inicio en lugar de llevar al usuario a una tarea?","options":["Que no requiere permisos","Ninguna","Se completa desde el propio registro","Que el proceso no necesita publicarse"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El formulario de inicio permite completar la acción en el contexto del registro.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What's the advantage of configuring a related action with a start form rather than sending the user to a task?","options":["It requires no permissions","None","It's completed from the record itself","The process needn't be published"],"explanation":"The start form lets the action be completed in the record's context."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Una lista de registros muestra muchas columnas y es difícil de leer. ¿Qué buena práctica aplica?","options":["Mostrar solo las columnas clave y dejar el detalle en la vista","Usar texto en mayúsculas","Añadir todavía más columnas para que el usuario tenga toda la información","Quitar los filtros"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las listas deben mostrar la información clave; el detalle va en las vistas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A record list shows many columns and is hard to read. Which best practice applies?","options":["Show only key columns and leave detail to the view","Use all-caps text","Add even more columns so users have all the information","Remove filters"],"explanation":"Lists should show key information; detail goes in views."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un record type de Proyecto necesita mostrar en su vista una cuadrícula con las tareas relacionadas. ¿Cómo se filtran?","options":["Con una constante",