"explanation":"Paginación, sincronización y columnas mínimas mejoran el rendimiento de las listas.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does Appian recommend so record lists load fast with lots of data?","options":["Using queries in loops","Paging, using sync and showing only needed columns","Disabling paging to show everything at once","Adding every column"],"explanation":"Paging, sync and minimal columns improve list performance."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un proceso de \"Nuevo cliente\" se inicia desde la lista de clientes. Tras completarlo, el usuario debería ver el nuevo cliente en la lista. ¿Qué garantiza que aparezca?","options":["Que el proceso envíe un correo al usuario con los datos del cliente","Que se escriba con Write Records en la fuente","Un filtro de usuario","Una constante"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Escribir en la fuente a través de Appian hace que el registro aparezca en la lista sincronizada.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A \"New customer\" process starts from the customer list. After completing it, the user should see the new customer in the list. What ensures it appears?","options":["The process emailing the user the customer data","Writing it with Write Records to the source","A user filter","A constant"],"explanation":"Writing to the source via Appian makes the record appear in the synced list."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Una related action debe abrir un formulario prellenado con los datos actuales del registro. ¿Cómo recibe el formulario esos datos?","options":["El formulario lee los datos de la vista de resumen abierta en el navegador","No es posible","El proceso recibe el identificador, consulta el registro y lo pasa al formulario","Con una constante"],"correct":[2],"explanation":"El proceso usa el identificador para obtener los datos y los mapea al formulario.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A related action must open a form prefilled with the record's current data. How does the form receive the data?","options":["The form reads data from the summary view open in the browser","It's not possible","The process receives the identifier, queries the record and passes it to the form","With a constant"],"explanation":"The process uses the identifier to fetch the data and maps it to the form."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos prácticas facilitan el mantenimiento de un record type? (Elige 2)","options":["No documentar las relaciones","Copiar el mismo record type para cada departamento","Relaciones definidas en lugar de duplicar datos","Guardar todos los datos en un campo de texto","Nombres de campo claros y descripciones"],"correct":[2,4],"explanation":"Claridad y relaciones bien definidas evitan duplicación y confusión.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two practices ease record type maintenance? (Choose 2)","options":["Not documenting relationships","Copying the same record type for each department","Defined relationships instead of duplicating data","Storing all data in a text field","Clear field names and descriptions"],"explanation":"Clarity and well-defined relationships avoid duplication and confusion."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica la opción de sincronización de un record type?","options":["Que se sincroniza el diseño de las interfaces","Que los datos se envían a otro entorno de Appian automáticamente","Que se sincronizan los grupos","Que Appian guarda una copia de los datos de la fuente"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"La sincronización almacena en Appian los datos de la fuente.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does a record type's sync option indicate?","options":["Interface design is synced","Data is automatically sent to another Appian environment","Groups are synced","That Appian stores a copy of the source data"],"explanation":"Sync stores source data in Appian."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un record type necesita mostrar en su lista el número de pedidos de cada cliente. ¿Cómo se consigue con records?","options":["Con un grupo","Con una columna que ejecuta una consulta por cada fila de la lista","Con un filtro","Con un campo personalizado de agregación sobre la relación con pedidos"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Las agregaciones como campos personalizados evitan consultas por fila.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A record type must show each customer's order count in its list. How is this done with records?","options":["With a group","With a column running one query per list row","With a filter","With an aggregation custom field over the orders relationship"],"explanation":"Aggregations as custom fields avoid per-row queries."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué tipo de relación necesita una tabla intermedia?","options":["Uno a uno","Muchos a muchos","Muchos a uno","Uno a muchos"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Las relaciones muchos a muchos se resuelven mediante una entidad intermedia.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which relationship type needs a join table?","options":["One-to-one","Many-to-many","Many-to-one","One-to-many"],"explanation":"Many-to-many relationships are resolved via an intermediate entity."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un desarrollador quiere que los usuarios de soporte vean todos los campos de un cliente salvo los datos bancarios. ¿Qué enfoque encaja?","options":["Mostrarlos solo a grupos autorizados y limitar su consulta","No mostrar nada","Crear un segundo record type con los mismos datos sin los campos bancarios","Ocultar el campo con un color blanco"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"La visibilidad por grupo y el control de acceso a los datos protegen campos sensibles.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A developer wants support users to see all customer fields except banking details. Which approach fits?","options":["Show them only to authorized groups and restrict querying","Show nothing","Create a second record type with the same data minus banking fields","Hide the field with white text"],"explanation":"Group-based visibility and data access control protect sensitive fields."}}},{"doma