 nivel de registro antes de desplegar. ¿Qué prueba es adecuada?","options":["Probar solo con un administrador del sistema","Probar en producción","No probar","Entrar con usuarios de cada grupo y revisar lo que ven"],"correct":[3],"explanation":"Las reglas de seguridad se verifican con usuarios que representen cada perfil.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A developer wants to test record-level security rules before deploying. Which test fits?","options":["Test only with a system administrator","Test in production","Don't test","Log in as users from each group and check what they see"],"explanation":"Security rules are verified with users representing each profile."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Una relación entre record types está configurada con campos de distinto tipo (texto e entero). ¿Qué problema puede aparecer?","options":["Se duplican los datos","La relación no se puede crear o no devuelve resultados correctos","Ninguno, Appian convierte los tipos automáticamente en todos los casos","Se borran los registros"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"Los campos de una relación deben tener tipos compatibles.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A relationship between record types is configured with fields of different types (text and integer). What problem can arise?","options":["Data is duplicated","The relationship can't be created or doesn't return correct results","None; Appian converts types automatically in every case","Records are deleted"],"explanation":"Relationship fields must have compatible types."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué dos ventajas aporta usar records como fuente de datos en cuadrículas y gráficos? (Elige 2)","options":["Eliminar la base de datos","Uso de campos relacionados y agregaciones","Paginación y ordenación integradas","No necesitar seguridad","No necesitar interfaces"],"correct":[1,2],"explanation":"Los records integran paginación, ordenación, campos relacionados y agregaciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"Which two advantages come from using records as the data source in grids and charts? (Choose 2)","options":["Removing the database","Use of related fields and aggregations","Built-in paging and sorting","No need for security","No need for interfaces"],"explanation":"Records integrate paging, sorting, related fields and aggregations."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un equipo crea un record type nuevo sin base de datos existente y no quiere escribir SQL. ¿Qué opción usa?","options":["Codeless data modeling para crear las tablas desde el record type","Crear las tablas a mano en una base de datos externa con un cliente SQL","Usar un CDT sin data store","No usar records"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"El modelado sin código crea las tablas desde Appian.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A team creates a new record type with no existing database and doesn't want to write SQL. Which option does it use?","options":["Codeless data modeling to create tables from the record type","Create tables by hand in an external database with a SQL client","Use a CDT without a data store","Don't use records"],"explanation":"Codeless modeling creates tables from Appian."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un registro debe ofrecer una acción \"Descargar contrato\" que genera un PDF con sus datos. ¿Qué combinación es adecuada?","options":["Una related action con un proceso que genera el documento","Una columna de la lista","Un filtro de usuario que genera el PDF al aplicarse","Una constante"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Las related actions inician procesos que pueden generar documentos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A record must offer a \"Download contract\" action that generates a PDF with its data. Which combination fits?","options":["A related action with a process generating the document","A list column","A user filter that generates the PDF when applied","A constant"],"explanation":"Related actions start processes that can generate documents."}}},{"domain":"D6","source":"bank","stem":"Un desarrollador quiere mostrar en la 